{10014}{I'm done with that...}{I'm done with that...}{}{7}{}{ }
{10015}{Indeed!  As if a dwarf would associate with someone who couldn't dress themselves properly!}{Indeed!  As if a dwarf would associate with someone who couldn't dress themselves properly!}{}{8}{}{ }
{10016}{Well...I must  say I've never been fond of barbarians...}{Well...I must  say I've never been fond of barbarians...}{}{9}{}{ }
{10017}{Strange company you keep, friend...}{Strange company you keep, friend...}{}{10}{}{ }
{10018}{Oh bloody blazes!  It's another magicker touting his spells.  You'd never see a dwarf acting so foolish...}{Oh bloody blazes!  It's another magicker touting his spells.  You'd never see a dwarf acting so foolish...}{}{11}{}{ }
{10019}{Ah.  Such a shame.  But such is what comes of magick...}{Ah.  Such a shame.  But such is what comes of magick...}{}{12}{}{ }
{10021}{What?  Who?  Damned wizards and their ways!  Show yourself, coward!}{What?  Who?  Damned wizards and their ways!  Show yourself, coward!}{}{13}{}{ }
