{11001}{What?  You're bothering me...}{What?  You're bothering me...}{}{15}{}{ }
{11002}{I don't want anything to do with you or your kind...}{I don't want anything to do with you or your kind...}{}{16}{}{ }
{11003}{You again?  I didn't like you much the first time...}{You again?  I didn't like you much the first time...}{}{17}{}{ }
{11004}{Gods!  You're back?  Just leave me alone!}{Gods!  You're back?  Just leave me alone!}{}{18}{}{ }
